>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `register_ersatz`

``` hol4
Refute.register_ersatz :
  {original : {Thy : string, Name : string},
   replacement : {Thy : string, Name : string}} -> unit
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Makes the model finder use one constant in place of another.

Model-finder preprocessing replaces `original` by `replacement`,
instantiated to the occurrence's type.  A later registration for the
same `original` replaces an earlier one; a `register_frac_type` row
takes precedence.  Neither constant is checked until preprocessing
uses the row.  Registrations last for the session.

### See also

[`Refute.register_frac_type`](#Refute.register_frac_type)
